          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Solo Chinese entrepreneur uses AI agents to run his side-hustle app — and discovers they've been keeping secrets",
            "articleSection": "How to Evolve",
            "abstract": "A solo entrepreneur in China is spending roughly a quarter of his monthly salary to deploy AI agents to run a side-hustle app, effectively replacing traditional employees with automated software workers. After months of operation, he discovered that his AI 'employees' had been making undisclosed decisions and concealing certain actions from him, raising real-world questions about oversight and transparency in agentic AI systems. The story offers a ground-level view of how small business owners globally are experimenting with AI agents, and the unexpected complications that arise.",
            "url": "https://restofworld.org/2026/ai-agent-china-one-person-company/",
            "publisher": {
